1
00:00:00,792 --> 00:00:04,421
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:13,346
<i>I've prepared something for both of you.</i>

3
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:16,808
<i>A prenuptial agreement that both</i>
<i>of you will sign, of course.</i>

4
00:00:16,891 --> 00:00:20,395
<i>It says there that should you</i>
<i>and Arnaldo decide to separate,</i>

5
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:22,272
<i>one hundred percent of your assets</i>

6
00:00:22,355 --> 00:00:23,648
<i>will go to Arnaldo.</i>

7
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:27,485
[Ivy] <i>No amount of money can</i>
<i>ever compare to my love for you.</i>

8
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:30,071
[Camia] <i>I promised Lily</i>
<i>that I would trust her plan.</i>

9
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:34,367
<i>But I can't allow those greedy</i>
<i>Ardientes to do this to her.</i>

10
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:35,660
[Ivy] <i>After the wedding,</i>

11
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:39,289
<i>we should prioritize</i>
<i>securing Arnaldo's victory</i>

12
00:00:39,372 --> 00:00:40,623
<i>in the elections.</i>

13
00:00:40,707 --> 00:00:44,169
<i>Now, you're talking like a true Ardiente.</i>

14
00:00:44,252 --> 00:00:46,004
<i>You should run for office.</i>

15
00:00:46,087 --> 00:00:47,672
[Ivy] <i>What about Emilia?</i>

16
00:00:47,756 --> 00:00:50,592
<i>Won't she be running</i>
<i>for a position like before?</i>

17
00:00:50,675 --> 00:00:51,676
<i>Excuse me.</i>

18
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,762
[Emilia] <i>Remember,</i>
<i>you're just a wife-to-be.</i>

19
00:00:53,845 --> 00:00:55,180
<i>I'm the mother.</i>

20
00:00:55,263 --> 00:00:58,892
<i>So, that means I will still be</i>
<i>the Queen of Ardiente.</i>

21
00:00:58,975 --> 00:01:01,352
<i>Your actions will only</i>
<i>get you into trouble!</i>

22
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:02,729
[Emilia] <i>I'd rather do it myself.</i>

23
00:01:02,812 --> 00:01:05,440
<i>That way, I'll take her life</i>
<i>with my own, two hands--</i>

24
00:01:05,523 --> 00:01:07,817
[Claire] <i>Then you'd better</i>
<i>do it successfully, Emilia!</i>

25
00:01:08,234 --> 00:01:11,488
<i>We have a teaching drive</i>
<i>in Barangay Siete.</i>

26
00:01:11,571 --> 00:01:12,864
<i>Maybe you'd like to come?</i>

27
00:01:12,947 --> 00:01:13,990
[Diego] <i>Of course.</i>

28
00:01:14,074 --> 00:01:16,826
<i>We'll bring more help</i>
<i>for the kids there too.</i>

29
00:01:18,536 --> 00:01:20,747
[Emilia] <i>I'm throwing a bridal shower</i>

30
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:22,540
<i>for my future daughter-in-law.</i>

31
00:01:22,624 --> 00:01:26,211
<i>Maybe you can let me borrow</i>
<i>some of your macho men</i>

32
00:01:26,294 --> 00:01:29,756
<i>to entertain</i>
<i>my daughter-in-law, Ivy Aguas.</i>

33
00:01:29,839 --> 00:01:32,509
<i>For his marriage, for his success…</i>

34
00:01:32,592 --> 00:01:33,635
<i>Viva Ardiente!</i>

35
00:01:33,718 --> 00:01:35,094
[in unison] <i>Viva Ardiente!</i>

36
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:39,516
[Ivy] <i>Is this part of your plan, Emilia?</i>

37
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:42,060
<i>Okay. Let's have fun!</i>

38
00:01:42,769 --> 00:01:43,728
-[water splashing]
-[women exclaim]

39
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:45,063
[Emilia] <i>Let's go get a drink.</i>

40
00:01:47,482 --> 00:01:50,110
<i>Oh, thank you, Emilia, but… I'm good.</i>

41
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:52,987
<i>Come on. Don't be such a party pooper.</i>

42
00:01:53,071 --> 00:01:54,906
<i>-Have a drink.</i>
<i>-You have it. Thank you.</i>

43
00:01:54,989 --> 00:01:56,199
<i>Come on, just a sip.</i>

44
00:01:56,282 --> 00:01:57,575
[Emilia] <i>You poisoned me!</i>

45
00:01:57,659 --> 00:01:59,452
<i>You poisoned yourself.</i>

46
00:01:59,536 --> 00:02:02,122
<i>This particular poison</i>
<i>is one of the worst.</i>

47
00:02:02,205 --> 00:02:04,874
<i>Your throat will constrict so tight.</i>

48
00:02:04,958 --> 00:02:06,835
[Claire] <i>You have to throw up!</i>
<i>You have to throw up, Emilia!</i>

49
00:02:06,918 --> 00:02:09,379
<i>Spit out the poison! Do it! Hurry!</i>

50
00:02:10,964 --> 00:02:11,840
-No, no, no, no.
-Mayor.

51
00:02:11,923 --> 00:02:12,674
Just let me explain.

52
00:02:12,757 --> 00:02:15,093
-This isn't part of the deal. Mayor.
-No, I just wanna be with you.

53
00:02:15,176 --> 00:02:16,636
I just wanna be with--

54
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:18,179
You're so sexy.

55
00:02:19,889 --> 00:02:21,558
[high-pitched ringing]

56
00:02:25,728 --> 00:02:27,814
Ivy, I've been waiting for this.

57
00:02:27,897 --> 00:02:29,649
I've waited for this
for so long. Oh, my gosh.

58
00:02:29,732 --> 00:02:31,526
Stay there, stay there.
Stay there, stay there.

59
00:02:31,609 --> 00:02:32,944
-Mayor…
-Stay there.

60
00:02:33,027 --> 00:02:34,946
You're very beautiful, Ivy.

61
00:02:35,029 --> 00:02:37,323
Ivy Aguas. I just want to talk to you.

62
00:02:37,407 --> 00:02:39,450
This isn't part of the deal.

63
00:02:39,534 --> 00:02:42,871
Ivy, come on. I've waited
for this for so long!

64
00:02:42,954 --> 00:02:45,081
I'm begging you. Please give it to me.

65
00:02:45,165 --> 00:02:47,750
I want you. I need you!

66
00:02:47,834 --> 00:02:50,044
-We'll finally be together.
-Mayor.

67
00:02:50,128 --> 00:02:51,212
No, no, no! Don't you want this?

68
00:02:51,296 --> 00:02:54,299
-You do, don't you? You want this, right?
-I didn't agree to this!

69
00:02:54,382 --> 00:02:56,801
You want this. You keep saying no.

70
00:02:56,885 --> 00:02:58,052
I give you everything you want.

71
00:02:58,136 --> 00:03:00,263
Why can't you give me what I want? Huh?

72
00:03:00,346 --> 00:03:01,556
Why are you giving me a hard time?

73
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,766
Mayor, I'm not Ivy!

74
00:03:03,850 --> 00:03:06,060
What are you talking about?! Huh?!

75
00:03:06,144 --> 00:03:08,062
I love you. Give it to me.

76
00:03:08,146 --> 00:03:09,731
[woman sobbing]

77
00:03:10,732 --> 00:03:12,483
[woman screaming] No, Mayor!

78
00:03:12,567 --> 00:03:15,695
-Why do you keep saying no?!
-[sobbing continues, screams]

79
00:03:16,779 --> 00:03:19,115
Why do you keep saying no? Huh?!

80
00:03:19,908 --> 00:03:24,412
Is it because of Diego?! Huh?!
For him to take my place?!

81
00:03:24,746 --> 00:03:25,830
I give you everything!

82
00:03:25,914 --> 00:03:27,248
And then, you're still refusing?

83
00:03:27,332 --> 00:03:28,666
We're getting married!

84
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:31,502
Ivy, we're getting married.
We're getting married.

85
00:03:31,586 --> 00:03:33,129
-Mayor, I'm not Ivy.
-I'm gonna take care of you.

86
00:03:33,212 --> 00:03:34,339
I'm gonna take care of you.

87
00:03:34,422 --> 00:03:36,424
-Mayor, I didn't agree to this.
-I'm gonna make you happy.

88
00:03:36,507 --> 00:03:38,426
I'm gonna make you happy.

89
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,928
I'm gonna love you.

90
00:03:40,011 --> 00:03:41,763
I'm gonna give you everything
that you need.

91
00:03:41,846 --> 00:03:44,307
And I'm gonna do anything that I want

92
00:03:44,390 --> 00:03:45,558
because you're mine!

93
00:03:45,934 --> 00:03:49,437
I'm yours and you're mine! You're mine!

94
00:03:50,021 --> 00:03:53,399
[woman] Let me go! [sobbing]

95
00:03:53,942 --> 00:03:54,943
[retches]

96
00:03:55,693 --> 00:03:59,405
-You have to throw up!
-Guys! Guys, I'm just joking!

97
00:04:01,741 --> 00:04:05,995
Of course, I wouldn't poison
my future mother-in-law.

98
00:04:06,079 --> 00:04:07,914
I didn't put poison in this!

99
00:04:08,539 --> 00:04:09,332
[chuckles]

100
00:04:09,415 --> 00:04:12,126
I'd rather get married than mourn.

101
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:14,170
Don't overshadow my moment.

102
00:04:16,172 --> 00:04:19,425
You mean, there's no poison
in that thing? Huh?

103
00:04:19,509 --> 00:04:22,303
None! I didn't poison you.

104
00:04:23,429 --> 00:04:24,264
Gosh, Emilia!

105
00:04:24,347 --> 00:04:27,267
You really made
my bridal shower memorable.

106
00:04:27,350 --> 00:04:30,687
I really had so much fun,
just like you said I would.

107
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:32,105
[breathing heavily]

108
00:04:32,188 --> 00:04:34,190
And I did tell you, Emilia…

109
00:04:35,024 --> 00:04:36,734
Don't try me.

110
00:04:37,277 --> 00:04:38,444
-[vial clatters]
-[shudders]

111
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:42,282
[labored breathing]

112
00:04:42,365 --> 00:04:44,033
-Emilia?
-I can't breathe.

113
00:04:44,117 --> 00:04:45,660
What?! Hold on.

114
00:04:46,202 --> 00:04:50,290
Emilia! Emilia! Hey! Emilia! Help!

115
00:04:50,373 --> 00:04:53,418
Somebody help us! Please! Emilia! Emilia!

116
00:04:53,501 --> 00:04:55,003
Emilia! Help!

117
00:04:57,255 --> 00:04:58,506
Wait for me here!

118
00:05:00,258 --> 00:05:02,176
[suspenseful music playing]

119
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:04,178
[woman] Mayor! [sobbing]

120
00:05:04,262 --> 00:05:06,931
[Arnaldo] I said stop! Stop!

121
00:05:09,851 --> 00:05:11,936
Don't you hear me?! I love you!

122
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:13,771
-[suspenseful action music]
-[Arnaldo] I love you!

123
00:05:13,855 --> 00:05:15,440
There's nothing you can do!

124
00:05:15,523 --> 00:05:17,775
-You are mine! You are mine!
-[woman, sobbing] Mayor!

125
00:05:17,859 --> 00:05:19,527
-Mayor!
-[Arnaldo] You are mine.

126
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:21,321
[woman] Mayor. [sobbing]

127
00:05:21,404 --> 00:05:23,364
I'm sorry. Ivy, I'm sorry.

128
00:05:23,448 --> 00:05:26,075
-[Arnaldo shushes]
-[sobbing]

129
00:05:27,618 --> 00:05:28,619
[Arnaldo] Let's make things clear.

130
00:05:28,703 --> 00:05:29,912
You're mine, right?

131
00:05:29,996 --> 00:05:31,539
You're mine. I'm yours.

132
00:05:31,622 --> 00:05:33,499
No matter what happens, I'm yours.

133
00:05:34,250 --> 00:05:35,084
I'm yours.

134
00:05:35,168 --> 00:05:36,711
-[woman] Mayor!
-[Arnaldo] You're mine!

135
00:05:36,794 --> 00:05:37,795
-You're all mine!
-[sobbing continues]

136
00:05:38,129 --> 00:05:39,213
You're all mine!

137
00:05:39,881 --> 00:05:40,965
-Huh?!
-[woman] Mayor!

138
00:05:41,049 --> 00:05:42,383
You're all mine!

139
00:05:43,968 --> 00:05:45,011
Come on. Please.

140
00:05:45,094 --> 00:05:48,389
Let's make some babies! I want 12 babies.

141
00:05:48,890 --> 00:05:50,641
Twelve little Arnaldos.

142
00:05:50,725 --> 00:05:53,728
Little Ardientes everywhere.
Our house will be--

143
00:05:53,811 --> 00:05:55,396
Reporting for duty, Mayor.

144
00:05:55,730 --> 00:05:57,815
[tense music playing]

145
00:06:00,818 --> 00:06:01,903
[exhales sharply]

146
00:06:06,699 --> 00:06:11,746
I like these calm, little
moments before the storm.

147
00:06:12,789 --> 00:06:14,165
[exhales sharply]

148
00:06:14,248 --> 00:06:15,124
Madrigal!

149
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:17,251
[suspenseful action music playing]

150
00:06:18,586 --> 00:06:19,629
Long time no see.

151
00:06:20,671 --> 00:06:21,756
Nice suit.

152
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:23,299
Just like old times, Mayor.

153
00:06:25,468 --> 00:06:28,012
The only difference
is that I work for Jaguar now.

154
00:06:28,096 --> 00:06:29,722
[breathes deeply]

155
00:06:29,806 --> 00:06:33,351
He wants me to tell you
that your days are numbered.

156
00:06:38,648 --> 00:06:41,692
[suspenseful music playing]

157
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:53,663
I should've killed you back then.

158
00:06:54,789 --> 00:06:55,832
You should've.

159
00:07:00,586 --> 00:07:01,587
[gunshots]

160
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:03,631
[suspenseful music playing]

161
00:07:05,007 --> 00:07:05,925
-What was that?!
-What was that?!

162
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:07,426
-[man] Where did that come from?
-Hey!

163
00:07:07,844 --> 00:07:09,971
Secure Arnaldo, hurry!

164
00:07:10,054 --> 00:07:12,348
[suspenseful music playing]

165
00:07:12,807 --> 00:07:13,641
[gunshots]

166
00:07:13,724 --> 00:07:16,477
-Come on! Take that! And that!
-[gunshots]

167
00:07:16,853 --> 00:07:19,230
[suspenseful music playing]

168
00:07:20,064 --> 00:07:21,065
[Arnaldo grunts]

169
00:07:23,818 --> 00:07:24,902
[gunshot]

170
00:07:28,281 --> 00:07:29,740
[gunshots]

171
00:07:32,452 --> 00:07:36,205
[Arnaldo] Go after him! Go! Hurry!

172
00:07:36,289 --> 00:07:38,583
[suspenseful music playing]

173
00:07:45,631 --> 00:07:47,467
Mayor, he's gone! He got away!

174
00:07:48,259 --> 00:07:49,135
[Arnaldo grunts]

175
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:53,931
Give me your gun!

176
00:07:56,225 --> 00:07:57,143
Come on!

177
00:08:00,146 --> 00:08:01,856
[Claire] Emilia? We're here!

178
00:08:04,317 --> 00:08:05,318
Emi--

179
00:08:07,612 --> 00:08:08,696
Emilia?

180
00:08:09,655 --> 00:08:10,531
Emilia?

181
00:08:10,615 --> 00:08:12,450
[suspenseful music playing]

182
00:08:13,201 --> 00:08:14,577
EMILIA'S WITH ME. DON'T WORRY,
I WON'T HURT HER.

183
00:08:18,289 --> 00:08:21,667
EMILIA'S WITH ME.
DON'T WORRY, I WON'T HURT HER.

184
00:08:21,751 --> 00:08:22,585
JAGUAR

185
00:08:29,926 --> 00:08:32,428
[mysterious music playing]

186
00:08:46,442 --> 00:08:47,735
Where am I?

187
00:08:49,111 --> 00:08:50,863
How did I get here?

188
00:09:10,633 --> 00:09:11,676
Jaguar?

189
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:13,594
[suspenseful music playing]

190
00:09:13,678 --> 00:09:16,681
Arnaldo! What happened?!
Did you fire shots?!

191
00:09:16,764 --> 00:09:18,975
Yes, I did! Madrigal was here!

192
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:21,727
He now works for Jaguar!
And he almost killed me!

193
00:09:22,395 --> 00:09:23,354
What?!

194
00:09:23,729 --> 00:09:25,898
Madrigal now works for Jaguar?!

195
00:09:25,982 --> 00:09:26,816
Yes!

196
00:09:27,817 --> 00:09:29,026
That son of a--!

197
00:09:30,528 --> 00:09:31,654
Those bastards!

198
00:09:33,364 --> 00:09:37,493
I am going to kill them all!
I will kill them all!

199
00:09:40,204 --> 00:09:42,832
[unsettling music playing]

200
00:09:42,915 --> 00:09:44,709
Why did you bring me here?

201
00:09:46,252 --> 00:09:47,295
[beeps]

202
00:09:50,590 --> 00:09:51,966
[in distorted voice] I saved you.

203
00:09:54,218 --> 00:09:55,469
I felt sorry for you.

204
00:09:56,721 --> 00:10:01,767
You were like a withered flower
when I brought you here.

205
00:10:02,810 --> 00:10:04,770
I want to take care of you, Emilia.

206
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,982
I don't need anyone to do that for me.

207
00:10:08,065 --> 00:10:11,027
I can take care of myself.
I'm a strong woman.

208
00:10:11,569 --> 00:10:12,528
[chuckles]

209
00:10:13,154 --> 00:10:14,739
Not exactly, Emilia.

210
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:19,493
You're just being manipulated
by the people around you.

211
00:10:21,078 --> 00:10:22,288
You've become weak.

212
00:10:25,541 --> 00:10:26,584
That's not true.

213
00:10:30,004 --> 00:10:32,006
Everything is under my control.

214
00:10:33,090 --> 00:10:37,803
Emilia, if you thought
you were strong before,

215
00:10:37,887 --> 00:10:39,180
well you aren't anymore.

216
00:10:40,806 --> 00:10:44,477
You've neglected yourself.
You're weak now.

217
00:10:45,102 --> 00:10:46,312
That's not true!

218
00:10:46,646 --> 00:10:47,772
Where's your husband?

219
00:10:48,314 --> 00:10:49,982
-He's not even looking for you,
-That's not true.

220
00:10:50,066 --> 00:10:52,193
or calling to know how you're doing.

221
00:10:54,028 --> 00:10:56,322
Meanwhile, your father and your son

222
00:10:56,697 --> 00:10:57,698
[chuckles]

223
00:10:57,782 --> 00:11:00,034
are both enjoying themselves
at a stag party.

224
00:11:00,785 --> 00:11:02,745
They don't care about you, Emilia.

225
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:04,955
[crying] That's not true.

226
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:05,915
[chuckles]

227
00:11:06,332 --> 00:11:07,833
That's not true!

228
00:11:08,668 --> 00:11:11,045
I'm strong. I can take care of myself.

229
00:11:11,128 --> 00:11:13,923
[dark dramatic music playing]

230
00:11:19,011 --> 00:11:23,015
Don't worry, Emilia.
You'll regain your strength.

231
00:11:23,808 --> 00:11:24,975
Believe me.

232
00:11:26,977 --> 00:11:28,062
Emilia…

233
00:11:30,106 --> 00:11:32,483
I want to lay my love on you.

234
00:11:37,238 --> 00:11:39,281
[tense music playing]

235
00:11:46,372 --> 00:11:47,456
[exhales sharply]

236
00:11:49,291 --> 00:11:51,669
[tense music playing]

237
00:11:56,132 --> 00:11:57,049
[grunts]

238
00:12:04,181 --> 00:12:06,434
[tense music playing]

239
00:12:28,414 --> 00:12:30,666
[tense music playing]

240
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:08,412
[Jepoy] <i>You got lucky tonight, Arnaldo.</i>

241
00:13:09,747 --> 00:13:11,665
<i>But your time will come.</i>

242
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:17,838
Okay.

243
00:13:18,589 --> 00:13:22,218
Stand watch outside.
Secure the entire area.

244
00:13:22,718 --> 00:13:25,179
Jaguar could attack anytime. Do it now.

245
00:13:25,262 --> 00:13:27,097
-Yes, Mayor.
-Now, hurry!

246
00:13:27,765 --> 00:13:28,849
[Arnaldo exhales sharply]

247
00:13:32,102 --> 00:13:34,688
Screw that bastard Jaguar.

248
00:13:35,898 --> 00:13:41,320
That son of a gun is becoming
a threat to the coming wedding.

249
00:13:41,654 --> 00:13:42,530
That's right.

250
00:13:42,613 --> 00:13:44,448
[stammers] So, what's the plan?

251
00:13:45,658 --> 00:13:47,117
The plan is…

252
00:13:48,661 --> 00:13:52,248
we'll do everything to stop that animal.

253
00:13:52,331 --> 00:13:53,916
Okay. Okay.

254
00:13:53,999 --> 00:13:54,959
[Julio] Come to think of it.

255
00:13:55,042 --> 00:13:57,836
I think you should have
your mother picked up,

256
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,421
as well as Ivy Aguas.

257
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:03,676
I'm sure he plans
to attack those two as well.

258
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:04,927
Okay, Grandpa. I'll go pick them up.

259
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:08,222
No, no, no, no, no!
Arnaldo, you stay here.

260
00:14:09,223 --> 00:14:11,850
If Emilia's and Ivy's lives are in danger,

261
00:14:11,934 --> 00:14:13,602
you're in twice the danger.

262
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,063
Truth of the matter is,

263
00:14:16,855 --> 00:14:22,027
I would rather Emilia
and Ivy die than you.

264
00:14:23,654 --> 00:14:25,781
You're far too important to me.

265
00:14:30,119 --> 00:14:32,288
We'll just send your bodyguards
to pick them up.

266
00:14:39,253 --> 00:14:42,965
Those kids were so inspiring.

267
00:14:43,465 --> 00:14:47,136
Diego… It's nice, isn't it?

268
00:14:47,219 --> 00:14:50,389
We really felt the strong
support of the people there.

269
00:14:50,723 --> 00:14:52,057
Take a seat.

270
00:14:52,141 --> 00:14:53,142
She's right.

271
00:14:53,225 --> 00:14:55,436
Those Ardientes won't be able
to one-up you anymore.

272
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:57,146
The people will finally be free.

273
00:14:57,730 --> 00:14:59,273
I'll make sure of it.

274
00:15:00,107 --> 00:15:03,694
Just a little more patience
and like what Ivy said,

275
00:15:05,237 --> 00:15:06,572
they'll all fall.

276
00:15:06,655 --> 00:15:08,616
[tense music playing]

277
00:15:12,119 --> 00:15:13,162
[music stops]

278
00:15:17,124 --> 00:15:18,334
[cell phone ringing]

279
00:15:21,754 --> 00:15:22,713
Hon?

280
00:15:22,796 --> 00:15:24,048
Finally, you answered.

281
00:15:24,632 --> 00:15:27,092
Are you okay? You sound nervous.

282
00:15:27,801 --> 00:15:28,761
Uh…

283
00:15:29,428 --> 00:15:32,640
I'm just worried about you.
Stay where you are.

284
00:15:32,723 --> 00:15:34,600
My bodyguards are on their way
to pick you up.

285
00:15:35,059 --> 00:15:37,394
Wait, what's happening?
Is there something wrong?

286
00:15:38,103 --> 00:15:40,940
That traitor Madrigal barged
into my stag party.

287
00:15:41,023 --> 00:15:42,524
<i>I almost got killed!</i>

288
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:44,443
<i>That bastard. If he thinks</i>

289
00:15:44,526 --> 00:15:47,071
Jaguar can protect him, he's wrong.

290
00:15:47,154 --> 00:15:52,952
Wait, what? Madrigal works for Jaguar?

291
00:15:53,035 --> 00:15:53,953
[Arnaldo] <i>Yes.</i>

292
00:15:54,036 --> 00:15:55,162
They're now in cahoots.

293
00:15:55,704 --> 00:15:58,499
And I know they will do
everything to stop our wedding.

294
00:15:59,875 --> 00:16:02,753
[suspenseful music playing]

295
00:16:10,386 --> 00:16:12,388
[unsettling music playing]

296
00:16:36,161 --> 00:16:38,622
Why don't you want to show
your face to me?

297
00:16:39,206 --> 00:16:41,125
Because you might see me differently.

298
00:16:49,383 --> 00:16:52,344
[gloomy piano music playing]

299
00:17:17,244 --> 00:17:18,829
Where could Jepoy be?

300
00:17:19,788 --> 00:17:21,040
Where did he go?

301
00:17:22,541 --> 00:17:23,625
[sighs]

302
00:17:24,001 --> 00:17:25,002
[clicks tongue]

303
00:17:27,629 --> 00:17:28,672
Jepoy!

304
00:17:29,757 --> 00:17:32,468
Jepoy, where have you been?
I haven't seen you all day.

305
00:17:32,968 --> 00:17:34,553
I just walked around Ardiente.

306
00:17:34,887 --> 00:17:36,930
Where exactly did you go?

307
00:17:38,891 --> 00:17:39,850
I said I went to Ardiente.

308
00:17:39,933 --> 00:17:41,769
-Why do you keep asking?
-What are you hiding?

309
00:17:41,852 --> 00:17:43,020
-I'm not hiding anything.
-Let me see.

310
00:17:43,103 --> 00:17:44,938
-Anna!
-What's this stain on your shirt?

311
00:17:45,564 --> 00:17:46,648
-It's nothing.
-Come here.

312
00:17:46,732 --> 00:17:48,275
Anna, that hurts! Wait!

313
00:17:48,817 --> 00:17:49,943
Let me see!

314
00:17:50,027 --> 00:17:51,153
[tense music playing]

315
00:17:51,236 --> 00:17:53,781
Jepoy, what's that? Why are you wounded?!

316
00:17:53,864 --> 00:17:55,240
Who did this to you?!

317
00:17:56,658 --> 00:17:58,118
I came face-to-face with Arnaldo.

318
00:17:58,202 --> 00:17:59,703
Too bad I wasn't able to kill him.

319
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:01,872
[breathes sharply]

320
00:18:01,955 --> 00:18:04,374
What? Arnaldo?!

321
00:18:06,293 --> 00:18:09,421
How could you be so careless, Jepoy?!

322
00:18:09,505 --> 00:18:10,964
Anna, this is nothing.

323
00:18:11,048 --> 00:18:12,508
-I'm fine.
-No, you're not!

324
00:18:12,591 --> 00:18:14,093
What if you get caught next time?

325
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:16,261
Or worse, you get killed!
You're throwing your life away!

326
00:18:16,345 --> 00:18:18,597
I won't let him catch me alive!
I'd rather shoot myself in the head, Anna!

327
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:20,432
[gloomy piano music playing]

328
00:18:20,516 --> 00:18:22,768
I'll do anything to stop them
from getting married.

329
00:18:27,147 --> 00:18:28,649
Jepoy, I know you're mad.

330
00:18:28,732 --> 00:18:30,901
But you have to get a hold of yourself

331
00:18:30,984 --> 00:18:34,071
because your anger could ruin
both your life and Ivy's plans!

332
00:18:37,616 --> 00:18:38,826
[cell phone ringing]

333
00:18:45,582 --> 00:18:46,750
[ringing continues]

334
00:18:46,834 --> 00:18:47,626
Mm.

335
00:18:55,008 --> 00:18:55,759
Ivy?

336
00:18:55,843 --> 00:18:57,761
Jepoy, where are you? We need to talk.

337
00:18:57,845 --> 00:19:00,347
We have to meet right now.

338
00:19:01,974 --> 00:19:03,684
Okay. Where are you? I'll meet you there.

339
00:19:08,063 --> 00:19:10,524
See? I think Ivy
already knows what you did.

340
00:19:10,607 --> 00:19:12,818
I'm sure she's mad at you again.

341
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,654
I don't care if she's mad or not, Anna.

342
00:19:18,448 --> 00:19:20,367
I did all this for her.

343
00:19:20,450 --> 00:19:22,536
[gloomy piano music playing]

344
00:19:23,996 --> 00:19:28,542
Go get some rest, okay?
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

345
00:19:52,983 --> 00:19:55,569
[gloomy piano music playing]

346
00:20:06,747 --> 00:20:07,789
Wait. Hold on.

347
00:20:08,832 --> 00:20:09,833
What about Raul?

348
00:20:09,917 --> 00:20:11,126
[shushes]

349
00:20:15,464 --> 00:20:17,466
[Julio] <i>For years, I have watched you…</i>

350
00:20:17,549 --> 00:20:19,801
<i>You really won't stop?</i>
<i>What do you want? Huh?!</i>

351
00:20:19,885 --> 00:20:21,428
<i>-…begging…</i>
<i>-Why can't you stop</i>

352
00:20:21,511 --> 00:20:23,388
<i>being unfaithful?</i>

353
00:20:23,472 --> 00:20:24,806
<i>…pleading for his love!</i>

354
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:29,144
<i>But that Raul has never</i>
<i>had any love to give you.</i>

355
00:20:29,228 --> 00:20:34,107
<i>Papa's right. You make me miserable, Raul!</i>

356
00:20:36,235 --> 00:20:40,197
But you know, Raul cheated
so many times, so I could--

357
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:41,281
[moans]

358
00:20:44,993 --> 00:20:47,454
[dramatic music playing]

359
00:21:09,476 --> 00:21:11,520
[unsettling music playing]

360
00:21:14,648 --> 00:21:16,233
[Jepoy] <i>You don't have to do that.</i>

361
00:21:16,316 --> 00:21:19,486
<i>I'm here. We're here!</i>
<i>We can bring the Ardientes down!</i>

362
00:21:19,569 --> 00:21:21,655
<i>You don't have to use yourself</i>
<i>as bait to catch Arnaldo!</i>

363
00:21:21,738 --> 00:21:23,073
<i>-Jepoy.</i>
<i>-What?!</i>

364
00:21:23,532 --> 00:21:25,492
<i>Diego, will you just sit around</i>

365
00:21:25,575 --> 00:21:28,078
<i>while Ivy and Arnaldo get married?!</i>

366
00:21:28,161 --> 00:21:31,873
<i>Jepoy. Jepoy, of all people,</i>
<i>shouldn't you be the one</i>

367
00:21:31,957 --> 00:21:35,252
<i>who understands why I need</i>
<i>to marry Arnaldo?!</i>

368
00:21:36,128 --> 00:21:37,754
<i>The wedding will push through.</i>

369
00:21:37,838 --> 00:21:40,299
<i>Whether you like it or not,</i>
<i>it's going to happen!</i>

370
00:21:40,757 --> 00:21:42,759
[tense music playing]

371
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:47,431
[music stops]

372
00:21:53,061 --> 00:21:53,937
Ivy.

373
00:21:59,735 --> 00:22:00,819
You were hit?

374
00:22:04,072 --> 00:22:06,199
Did you think I wouldn't find out, Jepoy?

375
00:22:07,409 --> 00:22:10,454
Let me remind you, I know everything.

376
00:22:12,748 --> 00:22:16,793
What are you doing?
Are you going against my plans?

377
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:21,048
You almost killed Arnaldo.

378
00:22:21,465 --> 00:22:25,469
Wow, Ivy! Do you hear yourself?
I'm the one who got hit.

379
00:22:25,552 --> 00:22:27,429
I barely scratched Arnaldo!

380
00:22:31,683 --> 00:22:33,185
Are you still pretending?

381
00:22:33,268 --> 00:22:34,561
Or do you really have feelings for him?

382
00:22:35,103 --> 00:22:37,522
Have you forgotten about
what they did to Nanny Carlotta?

383
00:22:37,606 --> 00:22:39,066
Have you forgotten about--

384
00:22:39,149 --> 00:22:41,026
Have you forgotten
about what they did to me?!

385
00:22:43,945 --> 00:22:45,697
Because everything the Ardientes did

386
00:22:45,781 --> 00:22:48,533
will forever be etched in my memory, Ivy.

387
00:22:48,909 --> 00:22:50,577
I didn't forget anything.

388
00:22:52,412 --> 00:22:57,167
Jepoy, you have no idea
how heavy my heart feels.

389
00:22:58,210 --> 00:23:03,048
How could I forget,
when every time I close my eyes,

390
00:23:03,131 --> 00:23:05,383
I see Nanny Carlotta hanging by her neck?

391
00:23:05,467 --> 00:23:08,053
Every time I try to sleep,
I get nightmares reminding me

392
00:23:08,136 --> 00:23:11,598
of all the horrible things
they did to my parents.

393
00:23:11,681 --> 00:23:14,226
Do you think I feel happy
every time I'm with the Ardientes?

394
00:23:15,477 --> 00:23:18,146
I find it hard to breathe
because I want to hurt them!

395
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:21,316
I want to kill them
for everything they did to you!

396
00:23:22,109 --> 00:23:25,987
So, I can never forget.
You have no idea, Jepoy--

397
00:23:26,071 --> 00:23:27,739
You're right. I don't know a thing, Ivy.

398
00:23:29,908 --> 00:23:32,327
Ever since I left,
you've kept me in the dark!

399
00:23:33,578 --> 00:23:35,163
Was I gone that long?

400
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:40,585
You never tell me anything!

401
00:23:41,086 --> 00:23:43,421
Everything I know,
I had to discover by myself!

402
00:23:43,505 --> 00:23:45,715
You used to tell me all your plans.

403
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:50,137
I don't even know you anymore.

404
00:23:54,724 --> 00:23:58,562
The Ivy that I knew wouldn't be
marrying that bastard Arnaldo.

405
00:23:58,645 --> 00:24:00,105
The Jepoy that I knew…

406
00:24:01,523 --> 00:24:04,442
would tell me all his plans.

407
00:24:04,526 --> 00:24:07,863
The Jepoy that I knew
would never join forces

408
00:24:07,946 --> 00:24:09,823
with that evil Jaguar.

409
00:24:10,907 --> 00:24:15,036
The Jepoy that I knew wouldn't
endanger other people's lives.

410
00:24:15,412 --> 00:24:16,830
The Jepoy that I knew

411
00:24:16,913 --> 00:24:20,041
would consult me first
before carrying out his plan.

412
00:24:20,125 --> 00:24:22,127
Fine, Ivy! Maybe I've changed.

413
00:24:22,627 --> 00:24:24,296
I let my emotions control my decisions.

414
00:24:24,379 --> 00:24:26,256
But I did everything for you.

415
00:24:26,339 --> 00:24:28,675
You didn't do them for me.
You did them for yourself!

416
00:24:28,758 --> 00:24:31,219
No, Ivy! I did all of that for you!

417
00:24:31,595 --> 00:24:33,180
I let my feelings get the best of me

418
00:24:33,263 --> 00:24:35,515
because I love you not just as a friend!

419
00:24:36,892 --> 00:24:37,934
I love you, Ivy.

420
00:24:40,854 --> 00:24:42,105
I love you so much.

421
00:24:46,484 --> 00:24:49,571
I've loved you since we were kids, Ivy.

422
00:24:49,654 --> 00:24:51,948
[somber music playing]

423
00:24:55,368 --> 00:24:59,164
That's why I can't let you marry Arnaldo

424
00:24:59,247 --> 00:25:01,583
because you will only
be miserable with him.

425
00:25:01,666 --> 00:25:04,669
And I will never forgive myself
if that happens to you.

426
00:25:04,753 --> 00:25:07,047
Jepoy, my life won't be miserable.

427
00:25:07,380 --> 00:25:10,383
It's the lives of the Ardientes
that will be miserable.

428
00:25:15,305 --> 00:25:16,348
Jepoy…

429
00:25:18,850 --> 00:25:20,518
Please listen to me.

430
00:25:21,228 --> 00:25:22,562
You and Anna should stay away

431
00:25:22,646 --> 00:25:25,398
because I don't want you
to get dragged into my plans.

432
00:25:27,567 --> 00:25:29,569
Why are you pushing me away, Ivy?

433
00:25:31,279 --> 00:25:33,114
I can't leave your side!

434
00:25:38,828 --> 00:25:40,121
Didn't you hear me?

435
00:25:42,749 --> 00:25:46,586
I said I love you.
I love you so much, Ivy.

436
00:25:47,671 --> 00:25:50,840
[somber music playing]

437
00:25:52,717 --> 00:25:54,761
Jepoy, if you really love me…

438
00:25:56,930 --> 00:25:59,766
you'll do what I say.

439
00:26:03,853 --> 00:26:07,357
[somber music playing]

440
00:26:14,072 --> 00:26:18,868
I've already lost so much.
I don't want to lose you too.

441
00:26:18,952 --> 00:26:20,662
I don't care if I lose my life, Ivy.

442
00:26:22,205 --> 00:26:25,417
I'll protect you until my last breath.

443
00:26:29,170 --> 00:26:31,798
I love you so much, Ivy.
I'll do that for you.

444
00:26:33,049 --> 00:26:34,384
You can't stop me.

445
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:38,638
[somber music playing]

446
00:26:47,022 --> 00:26:48,648
[breathing sharply]

447
00:27:04,539 --> 00:27:05,415
[exhales]

448
00:27:08,710 --> 00:27:10,086
[breathing sharply]

449
00:27:15,133 --> 00:27:17,802
[Jepoy] <i>Ever since we were kids,</i>
<i>you're all I have.</i>

450
00:27:23,475 --> 00:27:25,268
<i>You're my family and my friend.</i>

451
00:27:26,561 --> 00:27:27,687
<i>I'll protect you.</i>

452
00:27:28,563 --> 00:27:31,107
<i>I'll never leave your side.</i>

453
00:27:33,151 --> 00:27:36,696
<i>Whatever happens, I won't leave you.</i>

454
00:27:38,406 --> 00:27:41,701
[Ivy] <i>You're risking your life</i>
<i>every day just for me.</i>

455
00:27:41,785 --> 00:27:42,744
<i>Ivy, you don't understand.</i>

456
00:27:42,827 --> 00:27:44,496
<i>That's not enough because I love you.</i>

457
00:27:46,873 --> 00:27:48,833
[somber music playing]

458
00:27:58,885 --> 00:28:00,512
[sobbing]

459
00:28:18,988 --> 00:28:20,865
[sobbing continues]

460
00:28:34,629 --> 00:28:35,964
I must admit…

461
00:28:36,464 --> 00:28:38,758
I enjoy the feeling of being bad.

462
00:28:39,718 --> 00:28:41,511
I didn't know you were a great lover.

463
00:28:43,179 --> 00:28:44,973
That's why I've made my decision.

464
00:28:45,515 --> 00:28:49,436
I'll leave my father, and I'll join you.

465
00:28:49,978 --> 00:28:52,647
We'll take my father down together.

466
00:28:53,606 --> 00:28:56,276
You'll be the one
to make my dream come true.

467
00:28:56,860 --> 00:29:00,822
So, starting today, Jaguar, you are mine,

468
00:29:01,322 --> 00:29:02,532
and I am yours.

469
00:29:03,408 --> 00:29:07,704
You and I will be the king
and queen of this province.

470
00:29:07,787 --> 00:29:11,207
[suspenseful music playing]

471
00:29:20,091 --> 00:29:20,967
[door opens]

472
00:29:28,892 --> 00:29:30,018
[door closes]

473
00:29:39,736 --> 00:29:40,779
[sniffles]

474
00:29:50,622 --> 00:29:51,664
[sniffles]

475
00:29:58,129 --> 00:29:59,756
Jepoy, I'm right here, okay?

476
00:30:01,466 --> 00:30:02,926
If you need someone to talk to.

477
00:30:03,009 --> 00:30:06,638
[poignant piano music playing]

478
00:30:12,227 --> 00:30:13,228
Anna…

479
00:30:16,189 --> 00:30:17,899
Was I wrong to love Ivy?

480
00:30:23,112 --> 00:30:24,447
[sniffles]

481
00:30:24,531 --> 00:30:26,866
[Anna] It's never wrong to love.

482
00:30:28,159 --> 00:30:31,496
It's just that sometimes,
some things aren't meant to be.

483
00:30:33,331 --> 00:30:34,749
She does love you…

484
00:30:36,084 --> 00:30:37,669
But as a friend.

485
00:30:40,672 --> 00:30:43,925
Jepoy, let's just try
to be more understanding.

486
00:30:44,008 --> 00:30:46,761
Because all this
isn't easy for her, right?

487
00:30:48,263 --> 00:30:50,974
Right now, she needs you to support her

488
00:30:51,057 --> 00:30:53,351
rather than go against her.

489
00:31:01,818 --> 00:31:02,861
Anna…

490
00:31:02,944 --> 00:31:04,028
[sniffles]

491
00:31:04,112 --> 00:31:05,321
I'm sorry.

492
00:31:05,864 --> 00:31:07,323
Don't worry about it.

493
00:31:07,866 --> 00:31:11,244
You wouldn't be the friend
we call "Jepoy the Rascal"

494
00:31:11,327 --> 00:31:13,288
if you weren't stubborn.

495
00:31:14,205 --> 00:31:16,082
Do you understand?

496
00:31:17,959 --> 00:31:19,127
You're right, Anna.

497
00:31:19,210 --> 00:31:20,253
[sniffles]

498
00:31:20,753 --> 00:31:21,754
I am stubborn.

499
00:31:21,838 --> 00:31:23,047
[Anna laughs]

500
00:31:41,900 --> 00:31:42,942
[ice cubes clink]

501
00:31:48,698 --> 00:31:50,241
[unsettling music playing]

502
00:31:50,325 --> 00:31:51,659
Soon, Emilia…

503
00:31:52,577 --> 00:31:55,788
Everyone will bow down to you again.

504
00:31:56,664 --> 00:32:00,752
Because the real queen is so back.

505
00:32:04,422 --> 00:32:06,424
-I love being back.
-[cell phone ringing]

506
00:32:06,507 --> 00:32:07,467
Hmm…

507
00:32:11,179 --> 00:32:12,180
Hello, Aunt Claire?

508
00:32:13,598 --> 00:32:15,099
Thank goodness you answered.

509
00:32:15,767 --> 00:32:17,018
<i>I was worried about you.</i>

510
00:32:17,560 --> 00:32:18,728
I've been calling you.

511
00:32:19,854 --> 00:32:24,400
I'm so sorry for not answering.
I've been very busy with Jaguar.

512
00:32:25,360 --> 00:32:27,779
What did he do to you? Did he hurt you?

513
00:32:28,655 --> 00:32:29,656
[chuckles]

514
00:32:30,156 --> 00:32:33,493
It's the opposite, Auntie.
Jaguar pleased me.

515
00:32:35,995 --> 00:32:37,246
By the way, um…

516
00:32:37,664 --> 00:32:40,416
where are Papa, Raul, and Arnaldo?

517
00:32:40,500 --> 00:32:42,961
Your papa and Arnaldo are at home.

518
00:32:43,711 --> 00:32:45,755
I didn't tell them what happened
to you, by the way.

519
00:32:46,130 --> 00:32:48,633
But Raul and Ivy Aguas are not yet here.

520
00:32:48,716 --> 00:32:49,759
Huh?

521
00:32:50,927 --> 00:32:52,762
That's really fishy, Aunt Claire.

522
00:32:52,845 --> 00:32:55,765
But okay. I'll deal with Ivy Aguas later.

523
00:32:56,182 --> 00:32:58,851
I shall be home soon, Auntie. See you.

524
00:32:58,935 --> 00:33:00,144
Okay, take care.

525
00:33:05,566 --> 00:33:06,567
[chuckles]

526
00:33:15,284 --> 00:33:16,452
-Hi, Aunt Claire.
-Raul.

527
00:33:18,788 --> 00:33:20,373
How are you? Where's Emilia?

528
00:33:20,456 --> 00:33:21,457
[gloomy music playing]

529
00:33:21,541 --> 00:33:23,918
She's not home yet. But she's on her way.

530
00:33:26,045 --> 00:33:28,798
Weren't you with her
at Ivy's bridal shower?

531
00:33:28,881 --> 00:33:29,882
Yeah. Yeah.

532
00:33:30,883 --> 00:33:31,884
Where did she go?

533
00:33:31,968 --> 00:33:33,511
She said she had somewhere to be.

534
00:33:35,346 --> 00:33:36,806
She didn't take you with her?

535
00:33:37,682 --> 00:33:42,145
Uh… I think she's with some… some friends.

536
00:33:42,228 --> 00:33:44,355
[Emilia] Hi, Aunt Claire. Raul.

537
00:33:45,023 --> 00:33:45,773
Hey.

538
00:33:47,734 --> 00:33:48,735
[both kiss]

539
00:33:48,818 --> 00:33:49,819
Hi, Auntie.

540
00:33:50,445 --> 00:33:51,738
Where have you been?

541
00:33:52,697 --> 00:33:54,824
Um, I went out with some friends.

542
00:33:54,907 --> 00:33:56,701
We went to a bar.

543
00:33:56,784 --> 00:33:59,787
Why didn't you take Aunt Claire with you?

544
00:33:59,871 --> 00:34:01,914
We went to a bar.

545
00:34:01,998 --> 00:34:03,416
It would've been too loud for Aunt Claire,

546
00:34:03,499 --> 00:34:04,709
so I went alone.

547
00:34:07,128 --> 00:34:08,796
What about you? Did you just get home?

548
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:10,173
I've been calling

549
00:34:10,256 --> 00:34:11,424
-and you weren't answering.
-I was busy

550
00:34:11,507 --> 00:34:14,510
with our mining shipment.
The jewelry, remember?

551
00:34:14,594 --> 00:34:18,848
Oh. Okay. We were both busy,
so let's get some rest.

552
00:34:18,931 --> 00:34:20,725
Wait. What's on your neck?

553
00:34:20,808 --> 00:34:21,893
[tense music playing]

554
00:34:21,976 --> 00:34:23,394
-Huh?
-What's on your neck?

555
00:34:23,478 --> 00:34:24,520
[forced chuckle]

556
00:34:24,937 --> 00:34:26,647
-An insect bite.
-An insect bite?

557
00:34:26,731 --> 00:34:28,316
Hold on. Let me see.

558
00:34:32,612 --> 00:34:36,324
That's not an insect bite.
Someone bit you.

559
00:34:37,033 --> 00:34:38,868
Come on, Raul. So, vampires exist?

560
00:34:38,951 --> 00:34:42,121
I'm not joking around. Who did that?

561
00:34:42,205 --> 00:34:46,000
Do you have another man, Emilia?
Who did that?

562
00:34:46,084 --> 00:34:47,210
Huh?

563
00:34:47,293 --> 00:34:51,631
There's no other man, Raul.
You're the only man in my life.

564
00:34:53,758 --> 00:34:57,678
And now you're lying, Emilia.
Who did that to you?

565
00:34:59,138 --> 00:35:00,181
Listen to me, Emilia.

566
00:35:00,264 --> 00:35:02,725
Whoever did that to you
is going to deal with me.

567
00:35:03,684 --> 00:35:04,560
Who was it?

568
00:35:08,606 --> 00:35:09,941
Unbelievable.

569
00:35:10,024 --> 00:35:11,109
Raul, stop.

570
00:35:15,571 --> 00:35:16,447
Raul…

571
00:35:19,867 --> 00:35:21,619
There is no other man.

572
00:35:22,495 --> 00:35:24,497
You're the only man in my life.

573
00:35:31,921 --> 00:35:33,589
[suspenseful music playing]

574
00:35:33,673 --> 00:35:35,174
If you want to cheat, Emilia,

575
00:35:35,258 --> 00:35:37,176
go ahead and do it as much as you want.

576
00:35:37,260 --> 00:35:38,678
But remember this.

577
00:35:39,387 --> 00:35:41,556
You and your lover need to be careful.

578
00:35:42,765 --> 00:35:43,850
Because I'm going to kill him.

579
00:35:47,270 --> 00:35:49,939
[suspenseful music playing]

580
00:36:01,617 --> 00:36:02,743
[Emilia] I'll go take a shower.

581
00:36:08,249 --> 00:36:09,750
Grandpa, why are you still up?

582
00:36:12,420 --> 00:36:13,296
[groans]

583
00:36:14,505 --> 00:36:17,550
Arnaldo… Where's your bride?

584
00:36:19,343 --> 00:36:20,845
I had my men pick her up.

585
00:36:21,637 --> 00:36:22,930
They're on their way back here.

586
00:36:23,931 --> 00:36:25,057
My question is,

587
00:36:25,141 --> 00:36:27,894
where will I imprison her
until our wedding day?

588
00:36:28,811 --> 00:36:29,729
[chuckles]

589
00:36:30,229 --> 00:36:31,272
Good question.

590
00:36:32,231 --> 00:36:34,650
[suspenseful music playing]

591
00:36:41,407 --> 00:36:44,702
[gloomy music playing]

592
00:36:52,919 --> 00:36:53,961
[gun clicks]

593
00:37:35,670 --> 00:37:37,296
Even if I have to kill someone, Ivy…

594
00:37:37,755 --> 00:37:39,298
[suspenseful music playing]

595
00:37:40,841 --> 00:37:43,594
I swear you will not marry that bastard.

596
00:37:50,601 --> 00:37:51,435
[Ivy sighs]

597
00:37:53,521 --> 00:37:56,857
I don't know why they can't understand.

598
00:37:58,526 --> 00:38:02,530
Why can't they see that I need
to push through with my plans?

599
00:38:05,283 --> 00:38:07,743
Ivy, it's not like they can't understand.

600
00:38:08,995 --> 00:38:10,997
They're just scared that something bad

601
00:38:11,080 --> 00:38:12,206
might happen to you.

602
00:38:16,085 --> 00:38:17,920
To be honest, Ivy…

603
00:38:20,756 --> 00:38:22,550
I'm worried too.

604
00:38:25,261 --> 00:38:27,763
I wouldn't know what I'd do
if anything happens to you.

605
00:38:27,847 --> 00:38:31,350
[poignant piano music playing]

606
00:38:39,942 --> 00:38:44,071
Diego, I know how deeply
concerned you are.

607
00:38:44,155 --> 00:38:46,240
I'm sorry for making you
all worry so much.

608
00:38:47,491 --> 00:38:49,952
But this is a risk I have to take.

609
00:38:51,412 --> 00:38:56,000
It's necessary
if I want my plans to succeed.

610
00:38:59,086 --> 00:39:00,087
I know.

611
00:39:01,589 --> 00:39:02,631
I understand.

612
00:39:05,301 --> 00:39:06,802
That's why I'm here for you.

613
00:39:16,729 --> 00:39:19,190
[poignant piano music playing]

614
00:39:34,163 --> 00:39:35,956
Thank you for everything, Diego.

615
00:39:37,792 --> 00:39:41,754
For your support, and for all your help.

616
00:39:49,011 --> 00:39:50,721
Ivy, I'm right here.

617
00:39:53,265 --> 00:39:55,017
I will never get tired of helping you.

618
00:39:55,101 --> 00:39:56,936
[guitar music playing]

619
00:40:08,697 --> 00:40:12,284
Is this the last time we'll see
each other before your wedding?

620
00:40:19,834 --> 00:40:24,171
Maybe… Maybe not.

621
00:40:34,473 --> 00:40:35,683
Thank you, Diego.

622
00:40:38,853 --> 00:40:41,188
Take good care of yourself, all right?

623
00:40:42,731 --> 00:40:44,400
Be careful, Ivy.

624
00:40:50,197 --> 00:40:53,492
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

625
00:41:25,733 --> 00:41:28,152
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

626
00:41:30,154 --> 00:41:31,363
<i>Take care.</i>

627
00:41:32,490 --> 00:41:33,491
<i>Thanks.</i>

628
00:41:38,245 --> 00:41:42,082
<i>Lily. Thanks for helping me out.</i>

629
00:41:50,966 --> 00:41:54,094
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

630
00:42:18,118 --> 00:42:22,498
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

631
00:42:45,062 --> 00:42:49,650
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

632
00:43:02,037 --> 00:43:05,749
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

633
00:43:41,035 --> 00:43:42,661
[song fades]

634
00:43:50,794 --> 00:43:52,254
-Hon.
-Hon.

635
00:43:53,672 --> 00:43:55,215
What's happening?

636
00:43:55,299 --> 00:43:57,343
I'm sorry I had my men pick you up.

637
00:43:58,302 --> 00:44:00,346
It's dangerous for you to be outside.

638
00:44:01,430 --> 00:44:03,682
Thank you.
You always prioritize my safety.

639
00:44:03,766 --> 00:44:04,808
Of course.

640
00:44:05,392 --> 00:44:07,645
In fact, Grandpa and I
decided that from tonight

641
00:44:07,728 --> 00:44:09,063
until the wedding day,
you'll just stay here.

642
00:44:09,146 --> 00:44:11,023
You aren't going out, okay?

643
00:44:13,692 --> 00:44:16,362
Congressman, hon,
that's like locking me up.

644
00:44:16,445 --> 00:44:17,988
That's exactly what it is.

645
00:44:18,989 --> 00:44:21,784
It should be like this,
so no one can steal you from me.

646
00:44:21,867 --> 00:44:23,577
This wedding must and will happen.

647
00:44:24,536 --> 00:44:26,914
[unsettling music playing]

648
00:44:26,997 --> 00:44:28,582
Okay? Yes?

649
00:44:42,471 --> 00:44:43,764
<i>We need to be alert.</i>

650
00:44:43,847 --> 00:44:45,516
<i>Something big will happen tomorrow.</i>

651
00:44:45,599 --> 00:44:46,475
<i>What do you mean?</i>

652
00:44:46,558 --> 00:44:49,728
[Julio] <i>I want the perimeter</i>
<i>of the wedding venue</i>

653
00:44:49,812 --> 00:44:51,480
<i>tightly secured.</i>

654
00:44:51,563 --> 00:44:54,483
<i>If anyone starts trouble, shoot them down.</i>

655
00:44:54,566 --> 00:44:56,735
[Ivy] <i>This town will finally be free</i>

656
00:44:56,819 --> 00:44:58,862
<i>from the hands of the evil Ardientes.</i>

657
00:44:58,946 --> 00:45:00,030
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

658
00:45:00,114 --> 00:45:02,699
[Jepoy] <i>I'm going to stop the wedding,</i>
<i>and I'll take out whoever gets in my way.</i>

659
00:45:02,783 --> 00:45:03,659
<i>Even you.</i>

660
00:45:06,036 --> 00:45:10,958
[Emilia] <i>Make sure that Ivy Aguas</i>
<i>doesn't enter the church alive.</i>

661
00:45:12,584 --> 00:45:16,004
[theme music playing]
